Read [`SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md`](SOURCE_OF_TRUTH.md) before writing code. The task board is
[`PROJECT_STATUS.md`](PROJECT_STATUS.md) and the working rules are [`AGENTS.md`](AGENTS.md).
